{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21915","headline":"寄赠薛涛 · 元稹","name":"寄赠薛涛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦江滑腻蛾眉秀，幻出文君与薛涛。\n言语巧偷鹦鹉舌，文章分得凤皇毛。\n纷纷辞客多停笔，个个公卿欲梦刀。\n别後相思隔烟水，菖蒲花发五云高。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21915.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21915","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}